    "text": "96\n\n Sara,\nUnderstanding how to navigate buying another accounting firm can really empower you to accelerate your wealth and the life-time success trajectory of your business.\nIf you can master this, opportunities really open up:\u00a0\nAvoid buying a business that is littered with landmines (and could make your life miserable and ruin all your plans)\n\nYou\u2019ll be well-equipped to hit the ground running the day of closing on your business\n\nYou'll be on track to keep growing your business through acquisition in stride\n\nYou can fast forward the success of your business\n\nWhether you're not sure how to evaluate a target's potential, or you're not sure what your financing options are and what you could even afford. Maybe you're further in and you want to know how to navigate your site visit. Maybe it\u2019s that you\u2019re buried, overwhelmed and lost in the diligence process. For a lot of my clients, I know I used to really get hung up on how to figure out what experts they need to hire.\nOur goal is to bring order out of the chaos and avoid the common traps that derail so many people so that you can close on your deal quickly and painlessly (or GASP, cut ties and leave if it\u2019s not the right fit).\nA success story doesn\u2019t always mean the deal goes through - sometimes success means you figured out what was wrong with the deal quickly and efficiently and move on fast.\nSo here\u2019s our first step:\n\nRecognize that no one can (or should) know the deal as well as you. It's not as much about hiring the right experts; sometimes, even in order to figure out who to hire, you need to become the expert.\nI want you to feel like you are the expert in the room.\nSara Sharp\nPartner\nSK&S Law Group\nPS When do accountants fall over? When they lose their balance.\nPPS Stay tuned on what we are working on. \nWant to get help with your deal now? Check out our YouTube channel here.\n\n Copyright \u00a9 2024\u00a0 Someday Consultants, All rights reserved. \n\n Our e-mail address is:\ninfo@dealacademy.org\n\n Want to change how you receive these emails?\n You can unsubscribe from this list.",
